t-gon-tai-tran','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-2-bat-gon-tai-tran/',0,'chuong','',0),(42,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','T뿯½i c뿯ẽ ng뿯ẽ anh ch뿯½ng h뿯½ng x뿯½m đ뿯ẽp trai ng뿯½y ng뿯½y sang nh뿯½ t뿯½i xin ăn k뿯½ l뿯½ sinh vi뿯½n ngh뿯½o th뿯ẽt nghi뿯ẽp. N뿯½o ng뿯ẽ t뿯ẽi h뿯½m đ뿯½ xem l뿯ẽ trao gi뿯ẽi Kim K뿯½, t뿯½i th뿯ẽy anh m뿯ẽc 뿯½u ph뿯ẽc ti뿯ẽn t뿯ẽ l뿯½n nh뿯ẽn c뿯½p 뿯ẽnh đ뿯ẽ!','뿯ẽnh Đ뿯ẽ Nh뿯½ B뿯½n Th뿯½ch Gi뿯ẽ Ngh뿯½o','','publish','open','closed','','anh-de-nha-ben-thich-gia-ngheo','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/truyen/anh-de-nha-ben-thich-gia-ngheo/',0,'truyen','',1),(43,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>\'Em h뿯½ng x뿯½m 뿯ƽi, anh h뿯ẽt ti뿯ẽn mua đ뿯ẽ ăn r뿯ẽi, cho anh xin b뿯½t m뿯½ đ뿯ƽ뿯ẽc kh뿯½ng?\' Ch뿯½ng trai g뿯½ c뿯ẽa nh뿯½ t뿯½i v뿯ẽi n뿯ẽ c뿯ƽ뿯ẽi t뿯ẽa n뿯ẽng.</p><p>T뿯½i m뿯ẽm l뿯½ng n뿯ẽu cho anh b뿯½t m뿯½ tr뿯ẽng th뿯ƽm ph뿯ẽc. Anh ăn ngon l뿯½nh nh뿯ƽ th뿯ẽ đ뿯½ l뿯½ s뿯ƽn h뿯½o h뿯ẽi v뿯ẽ.</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 1: B뿯½t m뿯½ tr뿯ẽng c뿯½ chua','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-1-bat-mi-trung-ca-chua','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-1-bat-mi-trung-ca-chua/',0,'chuong','',0),(44,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>T뿯½i v뿯ẽa ăn b뿯ẽng ng뿯½ v뿯ẽa xem tr뿯ẽc ti뿯ẽp l뿯ẽ trao gi뿯ẽi đi뿯ẽn 뿯ẽnh danh gi뿯½.</p><p>\'V뿯½ gi뿯ẽi th뿯ƽ뿯ẽng Nam di뿯ẽn vi뿯½n ch뿯½nh xu뿯ẽt s뿯ẽc nh뿯ẽt thu뿯ẽc v뿯ẽ... Giang Tr뿯½!\'</p><p>Khi g뿯ƽ뿯ƽng m뿯ẽt ng뿯ƽ뿯ẽi đ뿯½n 뿯½ng xu뿯ẽt hi뿯ẽn tr뿯½n m뿯½n h뿯½nh, t뿯½i s뿯ẽc c뿯ẽ ng뿯ẽm tr뿯½ s뿯ẽa: \'뿯ƽ k뿯½a... đ뿯½ ch뿯ẽng ph뿯ẽi l뿯½ c뿯½i t뿯½n sang xin m뿯½ t뿯ẽi qua sao?!\'</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 2: B뿯½ m뿯ẽt b뿯ẽi l뿯ẽ tr뿯½n m뿯½n h뿯½nh l뿯ẽn','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-2-bi-mat-bai-lo-tren-man-hinh-lon','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-2-bi-mat-bai-lo-tren-man-hinh-lon/',0,'chuong','',0),(45,2,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','Xuy뿯½n v뿯½o ti뿯ẽu thuy뿯ẽt l뿯½m m뿯ẽ k뿯ẽ c뿯ẽa tr뿯½m ph뿯ẽn di뿯ẽn l뿯½c n뿯½ m뿯ẽi 5 tu뿯ẽi. Thay v뿯½ ng뿯ƽ뿯ẽc đ뿯½i n뿯½ đ뿯ẽ sau n뿯½y b뿯ẽ tr뿯ẽ th뿯½, t뿯½i ng뿯½y ng뿯½y n뿯ẽu đ뿯ẽ ăn ngon d뿯ẽ d뿯½nh n뿯½ b뿯½o tr뿯½n, đ뿯ẽn m뿯ẽc b뿯ẽ n뿯½ cũng đ뿯½i ăn theo!','Xuy뿯½n Th뿯½nh M뿯ẽ K뿯ẽ C뿯ẽa Nh뿯½n V뿯ẽt Ph뿯ẽn Di뿯ẽn Nh뿯ẽ','','publish','open','closed','','xuyen-thanh-me-ke-cua-nhan-vat-phan-dien-nho','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/truyen/xuyen-thanh-me-ke-cua-nhan-vat-phan-dien-nho/',0,'truyen','',1),(46,2,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>C뿯ẽu nh뿯½c tr뿯ẽng m뿯ẽt nh뿯½n t뿯½i đ뿯ẽy c뿯ẽnh gi뿯½c: \'T뿯½i kh뿯½ng ăn đ뿯ẽ c뿯ẽa c뿯½ đ뿯½u!\'</p><p>T뿯½i đ뿯ẽt đĩa b뿯½nh bao kim sa n뿯½ng h뿯ẽi, th뿯ƽm n뿯ẽc m뿯½i s뿯ẽa xu뿯ẽng b뿯½n: \'Kh뿯½ng ăn th뿯½ c뿯½ ăn h뿯ẽt nh뿯½, ngon l뿯ẽm đ뿯ẽy.\'</p><p>B뿯ẽng c뿯ẽu nh뿯½c k뿯½u \'r뿯ẽt r뿯ẽt\' m뿯ẽt ti뿯ẽng r뿯½ to.</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 1: C뿯ẽu nh뿯½c m뿯ẽt l뿯ẽnh 5 tu뿯ẽi','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-1-cau-nhoc-mat-lanh-5-tuoi','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-1-cau-nhoc-mat-lanh-5-tuoi/',0,'chuong','',0),(47,2,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>Ch뿯ƽa đ뿯ẽy m뿯ẽt th뿯½ng, c뿯ẽu nh뿯½c đ뿯½ b뿯½m ch뿯ẽt l뿯ẽy ch뿯½n t뿯½i: \'M뿯ẽ 뿯ƽi, h뿯½m nay con mu뿯ẽn ăn b뿯½nh flan b뿯½ đ뿯ẽ m뿯ẽ l뿯½m!\'</p><p>Ng뿯ƽ뿯ẽi đ뿯½n 뿯½ng t뿯ẽng t뿯½i quy뿯ẽn l뿯ẽc đ뿯ẽng t뿯ẽa c뿯ẽa nh뿯½n hai m뿯ẽ con, 뿯½nh m뿯ẽt tr뿯½n ng뿯ẽp c뿯ƽng chi뿯ẽu: \'Th뿯ẽ ph뿯ẽn c뿯ẽa b뿯ẽ đ뿯½u h뿯ẽ hai m뿯ẽ con?\'</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 2: Thu ph뿯ẽc nh뿯½c con v뿯½ 뿯½ng b뿯ẽ','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-2-thu-phuc-nhoc-con-va-ong-bo','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-2-thu-phuc-nhoc-con-va-ong-bo/',0,'chuong','',0),(48,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','B뿯ẽy năm thanh xu뿯½n đ뿯ẽi l뿯ẽy m뿯ẽt c뿯½u \'C뿯½ 뿯ẽy c뿯ẽn anh h뿯ƽn\'. Ng뿯½y anh h뿯ẽy h뿯½n đ뿯ẽ ch뿯ẽy đ뿯ẽn b뿯½n ng뿯ƽ뿯ẽi cũ, t뿯½i đ뿯ẽt s뿯ẽch 뿯ẽnh ch뿯ẽp chung v뿯½ chuy뿯ẽn đ뿯ẽn th뿯½nh ph뿯ẽ kh뿯½c s뿯ẽng cu뿯ẽc đ뿯ẽi r뿯ẽc r뿯ẽ c뿯ẽa ch뿯½nh m뿯½nh.','Đo뿯ẽn Tuy뿯ẽt: T뿯½i Kh뿯½ng C뿯½n L뿯½ N뿯ẽ Ph뿯ẽ Trong C뿯½u Chuy뿯ẽn C뿯ẽa Anh','','publish','open','closed','','doan-tuyet-toi-khong-con-la-nu-phu-trong-cau-chuyen-cua-anh','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/truyen/doan-tuyet-toi-khong-con-la-nu-phu-trong-cau-chuyen-cua-anh/',0,'truyen','',1),(49,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>\'Xin l뿯ẽi An An, Vy Vy đang s뿯ẽt cao trong b뿯ẽnh vi뿯ẽn, h뿯½n l뿯ẽ d뿯ẽi l뿯ẽi tu뿯ẽn sau nh뿯½.\'</p><p>T뿯½i nh뿯½n v뿯½o m뿯½n h뿯½nh đi뿯ẽn tho뿯ẽi đang s뿯½ng, kh뿯½ng kh뿯½c, cũng kh뿯½ng l뿯½m lo뿯ẽn. T뿯½i th뿯½o chi뿯ẽc nh뿯ẽn đ뿯½nh h뿯½n đ뿯ẽ l뿯½n b뿯½n l뿯ẽ t뿯½n kh뿯½ch s뿯ẽn r뿯ẽi x뿯½ch vali b뿯ƽ뿯ẽc ra s뿯½n bay.</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 1: H뿯ẽy b뿯ẽ h뿯½n l뿯ẽ','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-1-huy-bo-hon-le','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-1-huy-bo-hon-le/',0,'chuong','',0),(50,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>Khi anh ta quay l뿯ẽi căn h뿯ẽ chung, t뿯ẽt c뿯ẽ đ뿯ẽ đ뿯ẽc c뿯ẽa t뿯½i đ뿯½ bi뿯ẽn m뿯ẽt kh뿯½ng c뿯½n m뿯ẽt d뿯ẽu v뿯ẽt. Căn ph뿯½ng tr뿯ẽng r뿯ẽng v뿯½ l뿯ẽnh tanh.</p><p>L뿯½c n뿯½y anh ta m뿯ẽi ph뿯½t hi뿯ẽn, t뿯½i kho뿯ẽn m뿯ẽng x뿯½ h뿯ẽi c뿯ẽa t뿯½i đ뿯½ x뿯½a s뿯ẽch m뿯ẽi k뿯½ 뿯ẽc v뿯ẽ anh.</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 2: S뿯ẽ bi뿯ẽn m뿯ẽt ho뿯½n to뿯½n','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-2-su-bien-mat-hoan-toan','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-2-su-bien-mat-hoan-toan/',0,'chuong','',0),(51,2,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','C뿯½ ph뿯½ng vi뿯½n chi뿯ẽn tr뿯ƽ뿯ẽng gan g뿯½c g뿯ẽp g뿯ẽ ch뿯½ng đ뿯ẽi tr뿯ƽ뿯ẽng c뿯ẽu h뿯ẽa qu뿯ẽ c뿯ẽm. Hai con ng뿯ƽ뿯ẽi t뿯ẽng ch뿯ẽng ki뿯ẽn bao sinh ly t뿯ẽ bi뿯ẽt t뿯½m th뿯ẽy b뿯ẽn đ뿯ẽ b뿯½nh y뿯½n v뿯½ ng뿯ẽt ng뿯½o nh뿯ẽt b뿯½n nhau.','Ng뿯ẽt Ng뿯½o Trong T뿯ẽm M뿯ẽt: Đ뿯ẽi Tr뿯ƽ뿯ẽng Đ뿯ẽi C뿯ẽu H뿯ẽa R뿯ẽt Chi뿯ẽu V뿯ẽ','','publish','open','closed','','ngot-ngao-trong-tam-mat-doi-truong-doi-cuu-hoa-rat-chieu-vo','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/truyen/ngot-ngao-trong-tam-mat-doi-truong-doi-cuu-hoa-rat-chieu-vo/',0,'truyen','',1),(52,2,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>Gi뿯ẽa ti뿯ẽng c뿯½i h뿯ẽ v뿯½ kh뿯½i m뿯½ m뿯ẽt, m뿯ẽt c뿯½nh tay v뿯ẽng ch뿯½i k뿯½o t뿯½i v뿯½o khu v뿯ẽc an to뿯½n.</p><p>\'Ph뿯½ng vi뿯½n nh뿯ẽ, đ뿯ẽng m뿯ẽi quay phim m뿯½ qu뿯½n c뿯ẽ m뿯ẽng s뿯ẽng c뿯ẽa m뿯½nh ch뿯ẽ!\' Đ뿯½i m뿯ẽt s뿯½ng ng뿯ẽi sau chi뿯ẽc mũ b뿯ẽo h뿯ẽ nh뿯½n th뿯ẽng v뿯½o t뿯½i.</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 1: Cu뿯ẽc ph뿯ẽng v뿯ẽn gi뿯ẽa kh뿯½i l뿯ẽa','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-1-cuoc-phong-van-giua-khoi-lua','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-1-cuoc-phong-van-giua-khoi-lua/',0,'chuong','',0),(53,2,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>Sau chi뿯ẽn d뿯ẽch c뿯ẽu n뿯ẽn th뿯½nh c뿯½ng, anh xu뿯ẽt hi뿯ẽn tr뿯ƽ뿯ẽc đ뿯½i truy뿯ẽn h뿯½nh v뿯ẽi b뿯ẽ đ뿯ẽng ph뿯ẽc th뿯ẽng t뿯ẽp, tr뿯½n tay c뿯ẽm b뿯½ hoa h뿯ƽ뿯ẽng d뿯ƽ뿯ƽng r뿯ẽc r뿯ẽ: \'Em đ뿯ẽng 뿯½ l뿯½m ng뿯ƽ뿯ẽi nh뿯½ c뿯ẽa l뿯½nh c뿯ẽu h뿯ẽa kh뿯½ng?\'</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 2: B뿯½ng hoa h뿯ẽng c뿯½i 뿯½o','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-2-bong-hoa-hong-cai-ao','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-2-bong-hoa-hong-cai-ao/',0,'chuong','',0),(54,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','Thi뿯ẽu t뿯ƽ뿯ẽng qu뿯½n bi뿯½n 뿯ẽi uy danh hi뿯ẽn h뿯½ch quy뿯ẽt t뿯½m v뿯ẽ kinh t뿯ẽ h뿯½n v뿯ẽi thi뿯½n kim ti뿯ẽu th뿯ƽ y뿯ẽu đi뿯ẽu. N뿯½o ng뿯ẽ n뿯½ng ti뿯ẽu th뿯ƽ 뿯ẽy l뿯ẽi tinh th뿯½ng v뿯½ ngh뿯ẽ, b뿯ẽn cung b뿯½ch ph뿯½t b뿯½ch tr뿯½ng khi뿯ẽn ch뿯½ng m뿯½ m뿯ẽn.','Thi뿯ẽu T뿯ƽ뿯ẽng Qu뿯½n H뿯½m Nay Cũng Mu뿯ẽn T뿯ẽ H뿯½n','','publish','open','closed','','thieu-tuong-quan-hom-nay-cung-muon-tu-hon','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/truyen/thieu-tuong-quan-hom-nay-cung-muon-tu-hon/',0,'truyen','',1),(55,3,'2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','<p>\'Nghe n뿯½i t뿯ƽ뿯ẽng qu뿯½n mu뿯ẽn t뿯ẽ h뿯½n v뿯½ ch뿯½ ta tr뿯½i g뿯½ kh뿯½ng ch뿯ẽt?\' Thi뿯ẽu n뿯ẽ m뿯ẽc h뿯ẽng y gi뿯ƽ뿯ƽng cung b뿯ẽn li뿯½n ti뿯ẽp ba ph뿯½t h뿯ẽng t뿯½m.</p><p>Thi뿯ẽu t뿯ƽ뿯ẽng qu뿯½n tr뿯ẽn tr뿯½n m뿯ẽt, l뿯ẽp t뿯ẽc gi뿯ẽu l뿯½ đ뿯ƽn t뿯ẽ h뿯½n ra sau l뿯ƽng: \'Ai n뿯½i b뿯ẽy th뿯ẽ? Ta v뿯ẽ kinh l뿯½ đ뿯ẽ xin ho뿯½ng th뿯ƽ뿯ẽng đ뿯ẽnh ng뿯½y đ뿯ẽi h뿯½n!\'</p>','Ch뿯ƽ뿯ƽng 1: H뿯ẽn g뿯ẽp 뿯ẽ tr뿯ƽ뿯ẽng b뿯ẽn','','publish','open','closed','','chuong-1-hen-gap-o-truong-ban','','','2026-10-07 12:08:41','2026-10-07 12:08:41','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/chuong/chuong-1-hen-gap-o-truong-ban/',0,'chuong','',0),(56,1,'2026-10-07 12:30:05','2026-10-07 12:30:05','T뿯½i l뿯½ 1 v뿯ẽ th뿯ẽn th뿯ƽ뿯ẽng c뿯ẽ, v뿯½ tr뿯ẽn chi뿯ẽn 1000 năm tr뿯ƽ뿯ẽc m뿯½ b뿯ẽ th뿯ƽ뿯ƽng n뿯ẽng ph뿯ẽi phong b뿯ẽ th뿯ẽn v뿯ẽ.','V뿯ẽ Th뿯ẽn Gi뿯½','','publish','open','closed','','vi-than-gio','','','2026-10-07 12:58:11','2026-10-07 12:58:11','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/truyen/vi-than-gio/',0,'truyen','',0),(57,1,'2026-10-07 12:30:05','2026-10-07 12:30:05','','38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a','','inherit','open','closed','','38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a','','','2026-10-07 12:30:05','2026-10-07 12:30:05','',56,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(59,1,'2026-10-07 12:30:33','2026-10-07 12:30:33','','38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a','','inherit','open','closed','','38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a-2','','','2026-10-07 12:30:33','2026-10-07 12:30:33','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(61,1,'2026-10-07 12:30:55','2026-10-07 12:30:55','','38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a','','inherit','open','closed','','38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a-3','','','2026-10-07 12:30:55','2026-10-07 12:30:55','',0,'https://muopdangcungcovingot.io.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38fabd22abd4da01252f36e2fd305a5a-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(62,1,'2026-10-07 12:40:32','2026-10